From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taixin Reverse <reverse@taixin.local>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:13:06 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] kernel: btsdio for the onboard AIC8800D80 Bluetooth half

CONFIG_BT was on for the USB dongle only; the -W module BT half sits
on the SAME SDIO bus as WiFi and needs CONFIG_BT_HCIBTSDIO: once
aicbsp enables the BT subsystem (fmacfwbt_8800d80_u02 firmware) the
generic btsdio HCI driver binds the SDIO function and hci0 appears
(S37bluetooth already waits for it). Fixes "no Bluetooth stack in
the kernel" on the -W boards.
---
 .../sg2000_duomodule01_sd/linux/sg2000_duomodule01_sd_defconfig  | 1 +
 build/boards/sg200x/sg2002_duo_sd/linux/sg2002_duo_sd_defconfig  | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/build/boards/sg200x/sg2000_duomodule01_sd/linux/sg2000_duomodule01_sd_defconfig b/build/boards/sg200x/sg2000_duomodule01_sd/linux/sg2000_duomodule01_sd_defconfig
index f1cf9b588..642fc7210 100644
--- a/build/boards/sg200x/sg2000_duomodule01_sd/linux/sg2000_duomodule01_sd_defconfig
+++ b/build/boards/sg200x/sg2000_duomodule01_sd/linux/sg2000_duomodule01_sd_defconfig
@@ -535,6 +535,7 @@ CONFIG_IP_MULTICAST=y
 CONFIG_BT=y
 CONFIG_BT_LE=y
 CONFIG_BT_HCIBTUSB=y
+CONFIG_BT_HCIBTSDIO=y
 # CONFIG_BT_HCIUART is not set
 # CONFIG_BT_HCIUART_BCSP is not set
 # CONFIG_BT_HCIUART_H4 is not set
diff --git a/build/boards/sg200x/sg2002_duo_sd/linux/sg2002_duo_sd_defconfig b/build/boards/sg200x/sg2002_duo_sd/linux/sg2002_duo_sd_defconfig
index 6fe1d19d5..b68a99b51 100644
--- a/build/boards/sg200x/sg2002_duo_sd/linux/sg2002_duo_sd_defconfig
+++ b/build/boards/sg200x/sg2002_duo_sd/linux/sg2002_duo_sd_defconfig
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@ CONFIG_CC_OPTIMIZE_FOR_SIZE=y
 CONFIG_BT=y
 CONFIG_BT_LE=y
 CONFIG_BT_HCIBTUSB=y
+CONFIG_BT_HCIBTSDIO=y
 # CONFIG_SWAP is not set
 CONFIG_SYSVIPC=y
 CONFIG_POSIX_MQUEUE=y
